@startuml
title Plane State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Order

state Arrival
Arrival : do / plane arrives at base

state Preparation
Preparation : do / prepare for operations or maintenance

state Operations
Operations : do / manage scheduled flights

state Maintenance
Maintenance : do / perform checks and servicing

state Retired
Retired : exit / permanently withdrawn from service

Order --> Arrival : delivered to base

Arrival --> Preparation : arrival complete

Preparation --> Operations : condition met for ops
Preparation --> Maintenance : condition met for maintenance

Operations --> Maintenance : no more flights or maintenance needed

Maintenance --> Preparation : servicing completed

Operations --> Retired : retired from service

Preparation --> Retired : retired during preparation

Retired --> [*] : end of lifecycle
@enduml
